#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.E.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Eight months ago an expedition composed entirely of robots was sent across the cosmos with the same objective. It encountered a fair share of obstacles along the way, apparently landing on planets that were unsuitable for colonization, even possibly outright hostile. Very recently all communications were terminated."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: ../help/help.S.txt:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hace ocho meses se envió una expedición compuesta enteramente por robots a través del cosmos con el mismo objetivo. Encontró una buena cantidad de obstáculos en el camino, aparentemente aterrizando en planetas inadecuados para la colonización, incluso posiblemente hostiles. Recientemente todas las comunicaciones fueron terminadas."
msgstr ""
